# Committed on purpose: GitHub Pages builds from the repo, so the build reads
# its env from here. Public values only, every PUBLIC_ var ends up in the HTML.
# Secrets go in .env.local (ignored) or in GitHub Actions secrets.

# The deployed origin, with no trailing slash. Everything SEO is built from it:
# canonical, hreflang, sitemap.xml, robots.txt and the og:image url.
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://joaocarmassi.com
